--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Original work in this project
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Procedural geometric characters are now partly Tripo base meshes with
in-game colouring (the student explorer, the three emperors, officials,
和珅, and the 滿族 courtier). The 漢族 soft-cap figure, farmers (straw
hat), and soldiers (helmet) remain original procedural models. The 南巡
escort junks (the visible flagship uses the Meshy imperial boat above),
outdoor terrain and sea, gameplay, dialogue, and user interface are
original works created for this classroom game.

No official imperial portraits, copyrighted textbook art, or brand IP
are included.

